              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "gix"
            },
            "reviewBody": "We love this sauce! Simple, quick, easy, but good enough for when you don't know what to serve for dinner. Even my husband who usually watches how much he eats came back for a third serving. Thanks for this one!",
            "datePublished": "2012-01-04T12:26:54.950Z"
          },
          {
            "@type": "Review",
            "reviewRating": {
              "@type": "Rating",
              "ratingValue": "4"
            },
            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "motomoto"
            },
            "reviewBody": "So simple you cant mess it up, tastes wonderful. I was wondering what to do with the can of minced clams I had in the cupboard. Used fresh tomatoes and dried parsley bc its what I had. Yummy.",
            "datePublished": "2010-03-01T11:14:14.173Z"
          },
          {
            "@type": "Review",
            "reviewRating": {
              "@type": "Rating",
              "ratingValue": "5"
